ay to the second roadway where taxis should be to your left. From the C gates, cross the roadway and go east toward the main terminal where you will find the taxis on your left as you near the center of the parking area If there are no taxis, please use the phone at the cab stand to have one dispatched immediately."},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"Under the contracts with the TAA; taxi rates are set at $5.50 to start and $2.25 per mile with a $12.00 minimum fare. There can also be a charge for traffic delays of up to $22.00 per hour. There are no additional charges for up to three passengers or normal baggage.","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":291.3333333333333,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":322.3333333333333,"r":577.6666666666666,"t":349.6666666666667},"charspan":[0,267],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/26","text":"Under the contracts with the TAA; taxi rates are set at $5.50 to start and $2.25 per mile with a $12.00 minimum fare. There can also be a charge for traffic delays of up to $22.00 per hour. There are no additional charges for up to three passengers or normal baggage."},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"section_header","level":1,"orig":"ADDITIONAL TRANSPORTATION OPTIONS","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":272.66666666666663,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":324.0,"r":520.3333333333334,"t":283.6666666666667},"charspan":[0,33],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/27","text":"ADDITIONAL TRANSPORTATION OPTIONS"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"For additional transportation options; please contact the concierge at Loews Ventana Canyon Resort at (520) 299-2020.","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":227.66666666666663,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":322.6666666666667,"r":559.6666666666666,"t":261.66666666666663},"charspan":[0,117],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/28","text":"For additional transportation options; please contact the concierge at Loews Vent